title: Agent-Driven UI shipped — Paradigm becomes a shared workspace
summary: 'Implemented the Agent-Driven UI pipeline: 5 MCP tools (navigate, highlight, annotate, observe, clear) that let the AI agent drive the Platform browser UI in real-time. The architecture is MCP → HTTP POST → Platform server → WebSocket broadcast → browser Zustand store → visual effects. This turns Paradigm from "agent responds to text" into "agent and human share a workspace" — the agent can point at symbols, walk through code visually, and present decisions with toasts and callouts. User always wins via conflict resolution (idle → auto-navigate, active → prompt, muted → discard).'
